			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150310101,
					"content": "Chief Acatl gathers people from the tribe to hear Varesa's report on the mushrooms.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310102,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310103,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atolli"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310104,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iansan"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310105,
					"content": "Okay, so it felt pretty normal in the moment, but hearing it back does sound kind of... ridiculous.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310106,
					"content": "This silence speaks volumes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310107,
					"content": "So, the mushrooms in the orchard are sentient? What a remarkable discovery!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310108,
					"content": "Yeah, without your investigation, who knows what could have happened?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iansan"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310109,
					"content": "Thanks for looking into it, and for collecting all this information!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Xoctli"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310110,
					"content": "Phew, what a relief... I was worried it sounded like I lost my marbles...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310111,
					"content": "Hahaha, it does sound far-fetched. After all, none of us have ever spoken to a mushroom.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310112,
					"content": "But, we know you're not one to lie, Varesa. Besides, the origin of the green mushrooms has always been a mystery to us.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310113,
					"content": "Thanks to you, we now know something sinister could be going on. So, we should do our part to help!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310114,
					"content": "Yeah, just let me know if there's anything I can do!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iansan"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310115,
					"content": "Wow, that didn't take much convincing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310116,
					"content": "Thank you, everyone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310117,
					"content": "Oh, wait, you said the mushrooms need to be cooked on high heat, right? I can do that for you right now — I'll be quick.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atolli"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310118,
					"content": "Alright, I'm back! I used cast iron, so it should be hot enough!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atolli"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310119,
					"content": "Whoa, it smells delicious! Suddenly, Paimon's hungry again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310120,
					"content": "W—Well, here goes nothing...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310121,
					"content": "Hmm...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bifrons"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310122,
					"content": "Wait, that's his voice!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310123,
					"content": "Hahaha, looks like you stumbled upon the right path, but this temperature does not demonstrate even a fraction of the sincerity I require.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bifrons"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310124,
					"content": "Did you really think some common stove could generate enough heat to earn the acknowledgement of the Sage-Lord?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bifrons"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310125,
					"content": "Humans are such a disappointment. You can solve my riddles when the answers are handed to you on a silver platter...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bifrons"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310126,
					"content": "But, as soon as there are no more hints... not a shred of intelligence in sight.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bifrons"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310127,
					"content": "Do try and use your brain this time, hehehe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Bifrons"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310128,
					"content": "H—How did it go? Did you hear the voice?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atolli"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310129,
					"content": "Ugh! Annoying menace of a mushroom!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310130
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310130,
					"content": "The Sage-Lord of Fungi said the heat's still not high enough. Hmph, Sage-Lord of nitpicking, more like!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310131,
						150310132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310131,
					"content": "Still, the only way to figure out his goal...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310133
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310133,
					"content": "Not high enough, huh... I guess that means we need a more powerful source of heat.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310134
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310134,
					"content": "Attention, everyone! We need items that can generate intense heat. Anything you can find!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Acatl"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310135,
					"content": "I'll see what I can do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Atolli"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310136,
					"content": "Leave it to me!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Iansan"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310137,
					"content": "We should take a look, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310138,
					"content": "Definitely! We're not super familiar with this area, though. Do you have any ideas?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310139,
					"content": "Hmm... Nothing concrete, but we could check around the volcano.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310140,
					"content": "It spews out all kinds of stuff. Maybe there's something we can use.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310141,
					"content": "Awesome, let's go! Paimon's gonna find something scorching hot and then throw it at that stupid mushroom's face!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310132,
					"content": "Is to keep playing along.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310133
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
