					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150310201,
					"content": "Hey, there should be some Avatars of Lava somewhere along this path...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310202,
					"content": "Their cores are really hot. It might be just what we need.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310203,
					"content": "Y'know, when you think about how everyone jumped to help us like that, it seems like your tribe has been suspicious of the green mushrooms for a while.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310204,
					"content": "Yeah, but without you, we would have never gotten this far. I mean, tons of people have tried that mushroom without a weird voice talking in their head.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310205,
					"content": "Right... So, even if you wanted to investigate, you had nowhere to start...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310206,
					"content": "Yeah, this opportunity was a long time coming! Plus, the Sage-Lord's arrogant attitude definitely triggered my tribe's competitive spirit.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310207,
					"content": "Yeah, competitions seem to be a thing here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310208,
					"content": "Umm... Varesa doesn't seem competitive most of the time, though. Outside of training and fighting monsters, at least...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310209,
					"content": "Yeah, well... I don't really like fighting or competing, to be honest. Simple day-to-day happiness is what matters to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310210,
					"content": "Still, I've learned a lot from Coach Iansan. She taught me that strength is a means rather than an end.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310211,
					"content": "We get stronger so we can use our strength when it counts — like during the Abyss invasion. Having the training to master my Vision meant that I could do something to stop it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310212,
					"content": "So, no matter how scared I feel, I know I have to be brave, because people are counting on me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310213,
						150310214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310213,
					"content": "I can tell.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310215
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150310215,
					"content": "Thanks. It's a work in progress. I can only hope that, one day, I can be as brave as Lady Fietena.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310216,
					"content": "Alright, we should keep looking.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Varesa"
				},
				{
					"id": 150310214,
					"content": "There's a certain strength deep within you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150310215
					]
				}
			]
		},
